Source: sparky-core-fonts-dialog
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 14), cmake, qt6-base-dev, libdebconf-kde-dev (>= 1.2.1)
Standards-Version: 4.7.3
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://sparkylinux.org

Package: sparky-core-fonts-dialog
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, qt6-wayland
Description: KDE debconf licence window for the edition installer
 Embeds KDE's debconf frontend for the target system's Microsoft core-font
 licence. Offers explicit Accept and Decline actions, with Decline as the
 default, and treats a closed licence window as a refusal.
 No fonts or acceptance answers are shipped in this package.
